{"title":"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/7/df7dc189ae07b874946a12062a833c20d1d2c406.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-1|=|x-2|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"125\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/2/2528149de592f3ca8564c78b16c9d3c54150a6c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } -\\frac12 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } \\frac12 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 1 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } \\frac32 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"376\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/5/fb552300afddad49a8b28ca5d50402393a47616d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-1|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"18\" /> is the distance between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/b/1fb66ec93b6ea3313b9d1f313e7f49488c64a61b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-2|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"18\" /> is the distance between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, the given equation says <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is equidistant from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/c/a8c31ee2dfb8ea278390f17aff8ac3f279220440.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{1+2}2=\\frac{3}{2}\\Rightarrow\\boxed{\\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\frac{3}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"204\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p>Alternatively, we can solve by casework (a method which should work for any similar problem involving <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Absolute_value\" title=\"Absolute value\">absolute values</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Real_number\" title=\"Real number\">real numbers</a>).  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/a/b9afbaa16cfe6f80af3e0aad0641fcbe60dcae2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\leq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/2/9320a881b9ee0bc9b1b2fa2e0d722017add88118.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x - 1| = 1-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/0/f609876686b271d76e1a77894df9942be7f9add2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x - 2| = 2 - x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" />, so we must solve <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/c/e1c54a1195777a6a1b1e0b47747f9d699528eaab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - x = 2 - x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"107\" height=\"12\" />, which has no solutions.  Similarly, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/c/21cd6b8937bb07478e903e0186b41beefded34b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\geq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/c/b5c53ff7435934dfb0512a85fe6ecc6bc67a67ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x - 1| = x - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"116\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/4/43437de6ef081a3b6951dd156733cc58cda042f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x - 2| = x - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" />, so we must solve <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/6/a66aefae4219c316baa963b88953a86a9ecc36f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 1 = x- 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" />, which also has no solutions.  Finally, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/7/d3758d45bfc35e2180a37a86e6b112bd2a72845b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\leq x \\leq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/c/b5c53ff7435934dfb0512a85fe6ecc6bc67a67ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x - 1| = x - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"116\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/2/132d6ae102412103a9c3b66629c7109d8f56c2cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x - 2| = 2-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" />, so we must solve <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/8/308a7602408fbcef7d924511d4c3f8a8593ad43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 1 = 2 - x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"107\" height=\"12\" />, which has the unique solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/f/68f5aa884318503b832c11d16203b4bb7042e7b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We know that either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/4/0d4cf8b3fbf613842fe93ff5ed8df37cf6610033.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-1=x-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"107\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/8/df8ef9811cfa09d907b96dea4e2321a4880865fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-1=-(x-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"18\" />. The first equation simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d6147c7868f7a71e59918192adeff901fe2296f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1=-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"12\" />, which is false, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/8/df8ef9811cfa09d907b96dea4e2321a4880865fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-1=-(x-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"18\" />. Solving, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/6/326a639f8b4eb069c92145427e7ea690890cebf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{3}{2}\\Rightarrow\\boxed{\\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\frac{3}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"134\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Simply find the average of 1 and 2. Solving, we find the answer to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/6/326a639f8b4eb069c92145427e7ea690890cebf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{3}{2}\\Rightarrow\\boxed{\\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\frac{3}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"134\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A\">2004 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_24\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_25\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/-qx9vAkfCKw\">https://youtu.be/-qx9vAkfCKw</a>\n</p><p>Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017193544\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 272/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2320/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 154/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6004/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.576      1 -total\n 59.64%    7.500      1 Template:AMC10_box\n 39.23%    4.934      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:4074:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017193544 and revision id 284099. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}